      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To: All Employees\nFrom: [Your Name], HR Director\nSubject: Workplace Political Expression Policy\n\nAs a tech company, we value diversity of thought and opinion, but we also expect all employees to maintain a professional demeanor in the workplace. While we encourage open discussion and debate on internal channels, we will not tolerate inflammatory or harassing language, personal attacks, or divisive rhetoric that creates a hostile work environment. Employees are free to express their personal views on social and political issues, but they must do so in a respectful and considerate manner that does not disrupt the work environment or infringe on colleagues' rights. Any employee found to be violating these guidelines will be subject to disciplinary action, up to and including termination.",
